<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/addition> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType rim:additionAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains> ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/identifier-2026-11-17> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The object identifier of this item moves from https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/contains to https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains, which resolves through w3id.org (decision of 2026-11-17); the register actions of the item move with it, under https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/. The old IRI is kept as owl:sameAs. The content of the item is unchanged. Classified clarifying: the item is the same, only its identifier changes." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-17T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:affectedProperty rim:objectIdentifier ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/meaning-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/contains, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"Returns TRUE if this geometric object spatially contains anotherGeometry (no point of anotherGeometry lies outside this geometric object, and at least one point of the interior of anotherGeometry lies in the interior of this geometric object).\"" ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/operation-sources-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The keyword ST_Contains becomes an altLabel of the activity type; the sources defining the operation move to the activity type: OGC 06-103r4 Simple Feature Access - Part 1: Common Architecture, §6.1.19; ISO/IEC 13249-3:2016 Information technology -- Database languages -- SQL multimedia and application packages -- Part 3: Spatial, §5.1.11 ST_Contains; the illustration of the operation moves to the activity type." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/representation-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/geometry1 -> geometry-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"}); inputs/geometry2 -> geometry-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"})." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/sections-restored-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Corrects what https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/tools-2026-11-09 describes: the description sections removed then (sources, illustrations, data formats, multiplicity and the open question where present, and the Register position reference to the tier-4 process and its testbed URL) are restored. Tools and testbed stay in the prose; decision D4 applies to the model (keywords, source, properties), which carries none. Decision of 2026-11-09." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains/actions/tools-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Decision D4: 2 format keywords removed from inputs and outputs (inputs/geometry1: GML; inputs/geometry2: GML); description rewritten without tool, host or testbed. Each removed tool or testbed reference remains findable at tier 4, in bblocks-process-profiles." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/contains> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

